OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed for dodging speeding
OL,4,Afines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman who passed on their
OL,7,Fspeeding fines and penalty points to an
OL,8,Funwitting victim have been jailed.
OL,10,FAsad Ashraf, 48, and Jayna Mistry, 50,
OL,11,Fwere sentenced at Bradford Crown Court
OL,12,Fon Friday after admitting two counts of
OL,13,Fcommitting acts with intent to pervert
OL,14,Fthe course of public justice.
OL,16,FAshraf, of Westfield Close, Bradford,
OL,17,Fwas sentenced to three years and four
OL,18,Fmonths, while Mistry, of Pintail
OL,19,FAvenue, got three years and six months.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
