OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed for dodging speeding
OL,4,Afines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court had heard the victim received
OL,7,Fa letter asking for #706 in fines and
OL,8,Fcourt costs and five penalty points had
OL,9,Fbeen imposed after Ashraf and Mistry
OL,10,Ffalsely claimed the innocent person was
OL,11,Fthe driver of a car caught speeding in
OL,12,FBradford in 2023.
